    "body": "progress: bherbruck · 2026-11-08T01:28:42Z · cause bisected to #223 (c9a9fb3^1 passes): #223's roundness readings use only facets whose normal lines meet the axis within tol, and the D-flat's facets miss by part of the flat's width (0.2-0.4 mm), so the single wall pencil kept a ~39 degree skip at the flat. Fix committed on issue/246-dflat-fit (fork): `axis_point::faces_axis` - a facet square to the axis whose line misses by < half its own size faces it (a boss misses by far more than its size) - counted in the coarseness gate and the point-share pencil skip. Pinned by `axis_point::tests::a_single_band_d_flat_bar_reads_its_axis` (fails on main, passes here) and rotary_dflat 4/4; all 54 multiaxis unit tests (#208/#223 pins) pass. Full motion + app gate running; PR follows.",
